```

on the bastion:
***************
#sudo wget --no-check-certificate -O etc/bootstrap.key http://10.150.4.61:8080/switch/<SWITCH>/bootstrap.key
#sudo wget --no-check-certificate -O etc/bootstrap.pem http://10.150.4.61:8080/switch/<SWITCH>/bootstrap.pem

scp /nfs/scratch/switch_config/bootstrap.key /nfs/scratch/switch_config/bootstrap.pem cumulus@switch_ip:/home/cumulus

on the switch:
**************
cp /home/cumulus/bootstrap.key /home/cumulus/bootstrap.pem /opt/cm-lite-daemon/etc
sudo ztp -e


Register the Node
On the switch, add the head node to /etc/hosts:

echo "10.150.4.61 master.cm.cluster" | sudo tee -a /etc/hosts

and register the node with BCM

sudo ./register_node --host 10.150.4.61 --disable-cert-check


Approve the Certificate Request
On the head node:

cmsh
cert
listrequests
issuecertificate <request-id> --days 10000

Step 8: Start cm-lite-daemon Service
On the switch:

sudo systemctl restart cm-lite-daemon
sudo systemctl status cm-lite-daemon

Step 9: Verify Installation
On the head node:

cmsh
device
list